      ":question/problem": "![](images/a1/a1e31ad37f97fce4a13c990f39f72c9511671aca93607848f6d822c791698bcf.png)\n\nTriangles $ABC$ and $DEF$ each have a side measuring $3$ and a side measuring $5$, as shown above. Which of the following additional pieces of information is sufficient to prove that these triangles are congruent?\n\n1. The lengths of $BC^(\u2015)$ and $EF^(\u2015)$ are equal.\n2. The measures of $\u2220B$ and $\u2220E$ are equal.\n3. The length of side $BC^(\u2015)$ equals $7$.\n4. No additional information is needed.\n\n*(Note: Images not drawn to scale)*"
